{"seq":3,"slug":"risk-pricing-rate","title":"风险定价与利率","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-supply-chain-finance/credit-risk/risk-pricing-rate","wordCount":2447,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"风险定价与利率\">风险定价与利率</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>风险定价回答的是&quot;这笔钱应该收多少利息&quot;。它常被误解为一个业务谈判问题，实际上它是一个<strong>成本还原问题</strong>：利率必须覆盖资金成本、运营成本、风险成本与资本占用，剩下的才是平台利润。任何低于这个下限的定价，在数学上必然亏损，无论规模做多大。</p>\n<p>把每一项列出来，得到定价的基本恒等式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>利率</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>fund</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>ops</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>risk</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>capital</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{利率} = c_{\\text{fund}} + c_{\\text{ops}} + c_{\\text{risk}} + c_{\\text{capital}} + \\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">利率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fund</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ops</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">risk</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">capital</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>fund</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{fund}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fund</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是资金成本（平台从资金方拿钱的成本），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>ops</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{ops}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ops</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是运营成本（获客、系统、催收），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>risk</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{risk}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">risk</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是风险成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>capital</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{capital}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">capital</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是资本占用成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span> 是目标利润率。前四项之和构成<strong>保本利率下限</strong>，它是定价的硬约束。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[资金成本] --&gt; E[保本下限]&#10;  B[运营成本] --&gt; E&#10;  C[风险成本 EL] --&gt; E&#10;  D[资本占用] --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F{加目标利润率}&#10;  F --&gt; G[理论利率]&#10;  G --&gt; H{司法保护上限与监管约束}&#10;  H --&gt;|超上限| I[压到上限 或 拒贷]&#10;  H --&gt;|未超| J[分档定价表]&#10;  J --&gt; K[写入产品定价]&#10;  K --&gt; L[放款时固化利率]\">graph TD\n  A[资金成本] --&gt; E[保本下限]\n  B[运营成本] --&gt; E\n  C[风险成本 EL] --&gt; E\n  D[资本占用] --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F{加目标利润率}\n  F --&gt; G[理论利率]\n  G --&gt; H{司法保护上限与监管约束}\n  H --&gt;|超上限| I[压到上限 或 拒贷]\n  H --&gt;|未超| J[分档定价表]\n  J --&gt; K[写入产品定价]\n  K --&gt; L[放款时固化利率]</pre><p>风险成本是这五项里唯一与具体客户强相关的，也是定价模型真正的技术含量所在。它等于<strong>预期损失</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>risk</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>PD</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>LGD</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>EAD</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{risk}} = \\text{PD} \\times \\text{LGD} \\times \\text{EAD}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">risk</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PD</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LGD</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EAD</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>三个因子各有出处：PD（违约概率）来自评分模型，LGD（违约损失率）反映违约后还能收回多少，EAD（违约敞口）是违约时点上未结清的余额。三者的乘积就是这笔业务的期望损失，必须由利率覆盖。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成本项</th>\n<th>典型量级（年化）</th>\n<th>主要驱动</th>\n<th>是否客户相关</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>资金成本</td>\n<td>3%–8%</td>\n<td>资金方类型、ABS 发行利差</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运营成本</td>\n<td>1%–3%</td>\n<td>获客渠道、系统自动化率</td>\n<td>部分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>风险成本</td>\n<td>1%–15%</td>\n<td>PD、LGD、账期长度</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资本占用</td>\n<td>0.5%–2%</td>\n<td>杠杆倍数、监管资本要求</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>目标利润</td>\n<td>1%–4%</td>\n<td>平台战略</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"资金成本与资金方类型\">资金成本与资金方类型</h2><p>资金成本是定价里体量最大、也最不由平台控制的一项。不同资金方的成本差异可达数倍。银行尤其是大型银行的资金成本最低，但准入门槛最高、对资产质量要求最苛刻；信托、消费金融公司、小额贷款公司依次升高；资产证券化（ABS）的利差介于中间，但要求资产包足够分散、有历史表现数据。</p>\n<p>这直接影响平台的产品策略：<strong>低成本资金只能配优质资产</strong>。如果用银行资金去做高风险客户，光风险成本就会突破银行的容忍度。因此成熟平台会把资产按风险分层，低风险层配银行资金、中风险层配信托资金、高风险层配自有资金或小额贷款主体，形成&quot;资金分层匹配资产分层&quot;的结构。这个匹配动作的具体执行是第三章的资产分配，见 <a href=\"../funding-disbursement/funding-allocation\">多资金方资产分配</a>。</p>\n<p>资金成本还受<strong>市场利率环境</strong>影响。以中国的 LPR 为例，它作为贷款定价的重要参考基准，其调整会通过资金方协议传导到平台。工程上这意味着定价表不能硬编码利率，而应保存&quot;基准利率 + 加点&quot;的结构，基准利率的变更能批量作用于存量协议——但要注意，<strong>已放款合同的利率在合同期内通常不可变更</strong>，只有新放款才适用新利率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分档定价与风险调整收益\">分档定价与风险调整收益</h2><p>分档定价是把连续的 PD 切成若干档，每档给一个利率。分档的依据是 PD 区间，而非评分本身，因为 PD 才是进入成本公式的量。一个典型的分档表如下（数值为示意）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>风险档</th>\n<th>PD 区间</th>\n<th>风险成本</th>\n<th>定价利率</th>\n<th>额度上限系数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>&lt;0.5%</td>\n<td>0.4%</td>\n<td>6.0%</td>\n<td>1.0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>0.5%–1.5%</td>\n<td>1.8%</td>\n<td>8.0%</td>\n<td>0.8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>1.5%–4%</td>\n<td>5.0%</td>\n<td>12.0%</td>\n<td>0.5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>D</td>\n<td>4%–8%</td>\n<td>9.6%</td>\n<td>17.0%</td>\n<td>0.3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E</td>\n<td>&gt;8%</td>\n<td>16%+</td>\n<td>拒贷</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>分档粒度的选择是权衡：档位太少无法区分风险，定价偏离最优；档位太多则每档样本稀少，估计不稳定，且客户会挑档（跨档边缘的客户会想办法刷分跳到下一档）。实践中 4–7 档最常见。</p>\n<p>定价决策的真正目标不是利率最大化，而是<strong>风险调整后收益（RAROC）最大化</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>RAROC</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>收入</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>资金成本</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>运营成本</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>预期损失</mtext></mrow><mtext>经济资本</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RAROC} = \\frac{\\text{收入} - \\text{资金成本} - \\text{运营成本} - \\text{预期损失}}{\\text{经济资本}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RAROC</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">经济资本</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">收入</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">资金成本</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">运营成本</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">预期损失</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个公式解释了为什么&quot;给高风险客户报高利率&quot;未必正确：利率高会推高道德风险与逆向选择，实际 LGD 上升，RAROC 反而下降。当某档的 RAROC 低于平台资本回报要求时，正确动作是<strong>拒贷</strong>而不是继续加价——这正是上表 E 档直接拒贷的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"监管约束-司法保护上限与助贷新规\">监管约束：司法保护上限与助贷新规</h2><p>定价模型算出理论利率后，必须与监管约束取小。这一层在国内尤为关键，且变化频繁，必须持续跟踪而非一次设定。</p>\n<p><strong>司法保护上限</strong>是硬约束。根据《最高人民法院关于审理民间借贷案件适用法律若干问题的规定》，民间借贷利率的司法保护上限为合同成立时一年期 LPR 的四倍。这意味着任何以民间借贷形式开展的信贷，其<strong>综合资金成本</strong>（含利息、服务费、担保费等一切与融资相关的费用）都不能突破这条线。注意&quot;综合&quot;二字：把利息做低、把服务费做高不构成规避，监管口径看的是借款人的总融资成本。</p>\n<p><strong>助贷业务的规范</strong>是另一条主线。据公开报道，监管部门近年发布并细化了商业银行互联网助贷业务的管理要求，核心是：银行必须自主风控、不得将授信审批与风险控制外包；平台不得向借款人收取息费（或必须与银行收费合并计算并受上限约束）；增信服务费要纳入综合融资成本核算。这对定价模型的影响是<strong>费用必须合并建模</strong>：过去平台把收入拆成&quot;利息归资金方、服务费归平台&quot;的做法，在新规下必须按综合成本口径重新计算并受同一上限约束。</p>\n<p>把这些约束落到系统上，要求定价模块至少维护以下字段：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>综合融资成本（IRR 口径），而非名义利率</li>\n<li>各项费用的分项明细与收取主体</li>\n<li>适用的 LPR 基准值与取值日期</li>\n<li>上限校验的通过/失败标记，失败则阻断放款</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>跨境场景</strong>的约束完全不同：境外主体的放贷受当地牌照与利率上限法约束（各地差异极大），跨境资金流动还涉及外债额度与跨境融资宏观审慎管理。这部分属于第四章，见 <a href=\"../repayment-monitor/financing-compliance\">放贷合规/牌照/跨境限制</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"定价的落库与变更管理\">定价的落库与变更管理</h2><p>定价在系统里最终要落成一份<strong>可版本化的定价表</strong>，而不是散落在代码里的常量。一份规范的定价表至少要包含：产品标识、风险档、适用利率、费用项、生效区间、版本号、审批记录。</p>\n<p>放款时有一个容易被忽略的规则：<strong>利率在放款时固化</strong>。合同一旦签署，其利率在合同期内不随定价表更新而变化。这意味着定价表是&quot;模板&quot;，而每笔贷款保存的是&quot;实例化的合同参数&quot;。系统必须同时保存两个东西：这笔贷款用了哪个版本的定价表，以及最终执行的合同利率。审计时两者都要能查到，否则无法解释&quot;为什么同一档客户在不同时间拿到了不同利率&quot;。</p>\n<p>定价变更还需要考虑<strong>存量客户的处理</strong>。当资金成本上升需要调价时，平台只能对新放款与续贷生效，不能单方面变更存量合同。但平台可以通过额度调整间接影响：对不再符合新定价收益要求的客户，下调其额度或不再续贷——这是定价与额度联动的现实形态，额度侧的机制见 <a href=\"dynamic-credit-limit\">动态授信额度与调整</a>。</p>\n<p>最后，定价必须有<strong>回溯监控</strong>。每个月要用实际回收数据回算各档的实际损失率，与定价时的 PD 假设比较。如果 C 档的实际违约率是假设的两倍，那么该档实际是亏损的，必须立即调价或收紧准入。这个反馈闭环是定价模型不失效的唯一保障。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>定价是成本还原问题：利率 = 资金成本 + 运营成本 + 风险成本 + 资本占用 + 目标利润，前四项之和是保本下限。</li>\n<li>风险成本 = PD × LGD × EAD；PD 来自评分模型，LGD 与账期、增信结构相关，EAD 取违约时点未结清余额。</li>\n<li>资金成本决定资产分层策略：低成本资金只能配优质资产，形成资金分层匹配资产分层。</li>\n<li>分档定价 4–7 档最实用；决策目标是 RAROC 最大化，某档 RAROC 不达标应拒贷而非继续加价。</li>\n<li>司法保护上限按合同成立时一年期 LPR 四倍约束<strong>综合融资成本</strong>；助贷新规要求银行自主风控、平台息费合并计算，费用必须纳入同一上限。</li>\n<li>定价表须版本化、放款时固化利率并留存所用版本；每月用实际损失率回溯校准 PD 假设。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"风险定价与利率","id":"风险定价与利率"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"资金成本与资金方类型","id":"资金成本与资金方类型"},{"level":2,"text":"分档定价与风险调整收益","id":"分档定价与风险调整收益"},{"level":2,"text":"监管约束：司法保护上限与助贷新规","id":"监管约束-司法保护上限与助贷新规"},{"level":2,"text":"定价的落库与变更管理","id":"定价的落库与变更管理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"动态授信额度与调整","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-supply-chain-finance/credit-risk/dynamic-credit-limit"},"next":{"title":"资金方、助贷与联合贷模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-supply-chain-finance/funding-disbursement/capital-partner-model"}}